direction_556 = location "Stone Golem" about "Stone Golem\nStone golems are stones which ancient priests are said to have infused with life and employed as servants. With priests losing self-control subsequent to the War against Pathos, they attack all life in their vicinity." found "El Morad" at 84 1216 in zone 2

On offer
    Say "Did you obtain the bottom? Now all I have left is the top. The prey for this hunt is Stone Golem. Ancient priests infused stones with life and employed them as servants. But they've lost self-control and have turned into savage monsters now..."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "I wish you success in this hunt as well."

On claimable
    Show quest "Thank you. Here's the top, as promised."
